              ≤ 1 * (‖t‖ ^ 2 * M_scale ^ 2 * (D 0) ^ (1 - 2 * α)) := by linarith only [h0]
            _ ≤ C_st * (‖t‖ ^ 2 * M_scale ^ 2 * (D 0) ^ (1 - 2 * α)) :=
